{
    "title": "Mafia King",
    "description": "Looking for an exciting strategy game? Enter the world of Mafia King, a real-time global online mafia-themed war game! Experience a world where the gangs that were once loyal to you have turned their backs. Those who once called themselves your \"brothers\" now harbor ill will. The city you sacrificed everything for is now under the control of your enemies. You were framed, and everything has changed during the five years you spent in prison. Now that you have returned, the mafia city is in need of a new mafia Boss. Rally your former friends to fight alongside you and reclaim what is rightfully yours in this thrilling new mafia game!\r\n\r\nGame Features\r\n\r\n- Take Charge\r\n\"I'm in charge of this neighborhood from now on!\"\r\nForm your gang in the violent streets where criminals roam. Disrupt your enemies' plans, seize their properties and resources, and establish your dominance over the city. This city belongs to you!\r\n\r\n- Cosa Nostra\r\n\"Need a job? We're short of some good men.\"\r\nTurf wars are won through strength! The bar attracts gangsters from diverse backgrounds who could become valuable recruits. Skilled underground fighters, passionate bikers, and stoic gunmen make excellent additions to your expanding gang. Take control of the mafia war and grow your family!\r\n\r\n- Sin City\r\n\"Wealth is for those in power.\"\r\nWhy settle for just one mafia city when you can expand your influence to others? Like in many strategy games, you must plunder resources from other cities to strengthen your own. Show the gangsters who's the true boss by defeating rival gangs in turf wars. Put those naive ruffians in their place!\r\n\r\n- Family Power\r\n\"Don't piss me off. You won't like it.\"\r\nJoin or form Clans and form beneficial alliances with other gangs! Support each other and expand your territories. Engage in various Faction Events. Fend off rival gangs and show the underworld who's the real boss in one of the most intense turf war games!\r\n\r\n- Hot Babes\r\n\"Enjoy luxury cars and hot babes!\"\r\nMeet beautiful women from different regions and provide them with shelter. Take them on romantic dates to exclusive clubs and enjoy unforgettable evenings together. Use your charisma to make these women fall for you, the esteemed mafia boss! Collect car parts and assemble the most exclusive luxury cars to enhance your power and emerge victorious in this war!\r\n\r\n-------Information-------\r\nOfficial Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/GameMafiaKing\r\nOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/rEhdSYQRWD\r\nCustomer Support: help.mafiaking.android@gameshub-online.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for an exciting strategy game? Enter the world of Mafia King, a real-time global online mafia-themed war game! Experience a world where the gangs that were once loyal to you have turned their backs. Those who once called themselves your &quot;brothers&quot; now harbor ill will. The city you sacrificed everything for is now under the control of your enemies. You were framed, and everything has changed during the five years you spent in prison. Now that you have returned, the mafia city is in need of a new mafia Boss. Rally your former friends to fight alongside you and reclaim what is rightfully yours in this thrilling new mafia game!<br><br>Game Features<br><br>- Take Charge<br>&quot;I&#39;m in charge of this neighborhood from now on!&quot;<br>Form your gang in the violent streets where criminals roam. Disrupt your enemies&#39; plans, seize their properties and resources, and establish your dominance over the city. This city belongs to you!<br><br>- Cosa Nostra<br>&quot;Need a job? We&#39;re short of some good men.&quot;<br>Turf wars are won through strength! The bar attracts gangsters from diverse backgrounds who could become valuable recruits. Skilled underground fighters, passionate bikers, and stoic gunmen make excellent additions to your expanding gang. Take control of the mafia war and grow your family!<br><br>- Sin City<br>&quot;Wealth is for those in power.&quot;<br>Why settle for just one mafia city when you can expand your influence to others? Like in many strategy games, you must plunder resources from other cities to strengthen your own. Show the gangsters who&#39;s the true boss by defeating rival gangs in turf wars. Put those naive ruffians in their place!<br><br>- Family Power<br>&quot;Don&#39;t piss me off. You won&#39;t like it.&quot;<br>Join or form Clans and form beneficial alliances with other gangs! Support each other and expand your territories. Engage in various Faction Events. Fend off rival gangs and show the underworld who&#39;s the real boss in one of the most intense turf war games!<br><br>- Hot Babes<br>&quot;Enjoy luxury cars and hot babes!&quot;<br>Meet beautiful women from different regions and provide them with shelter. Take them on romantic dates to exclusive clubs and enjoy unforgettable evenings together. Use your charisma to make these women fall for you, the esteemed mafia boss! Collect car parts and assemble the most exclusive luxury cars to enhance your power and emerge victorious in this war!<br><br>-------Information-------<br>Official Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/GameMafiaKing<br>Official Discord: https://discord.gg/rEhdSYQRWD<br>Customer Support: help.mafiaking.android@gameshub-online.com",
